# AI runtime stack — top-level pins for BOTH variants (cu126 / cpu).
#
# One requirements.in serves both variants; only the torch index differs. Lock with
# compile-locks.ps1 (uv pip compile --generate-hashes --emit-index-url --index-strategy
# unsafe-best-match). Never edit the .lock files by hand.
#
# Every package here has a cp311 / abi3 / pure-python Windows wheel (Stage 0 §11 Q1):
# nothing is ever built from source, so the build box needs no compiler.
#
# Stage 0 changes vs the lab's v1 list: torchvision dropped (nothing imports it — proven by
# renaming it away), moderngl + glcontext added for texture baking later without a stack bump.
torch
transformers
einops
omegaconf
numpy
pillow
trimesh
scikit-image
rembg
onnxruntime
xatlas
safetensors
moderngl==5.12.0
glcontext==3.0.0
